{"ID":"20240314092259-vywwt3q","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092259-vywwt3q","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092259-vywwt3q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160157-e9fs0dv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160157-mojludk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160157-mojludk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:120,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:120\u0026#125;","title":"【黄芪桂枝五物汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422160201"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422160157-e9fs0dv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422160157-e9fs0dv","updated":"20240422160157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"血痹，阴阳俱微，寸口关上微，尺中小紧，外证身体不仁，如风痹状，黄芪桂枝五物汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160157-5tscyrd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160157-5tscyrd","updated":"20240422160157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芪桂枝五物汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160157-908ljak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160157-908ljak","updated":"20240422160157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芪三两，芍药三两，桂枝三两，生姜六两，大枣十二枚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160157-6zxptch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160157-6zxptch","updated":"20240422160157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右五味，以水六升，煮取二升，温服七合，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160157-9vfn7lv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160157-9vfn7lv","updated":"20240422160157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再来呢，诸位看，血痹呢，阴阳俱微，阴脉讲的是什么？尺脉，阳脉呢？讲的是寸脉，脉都统统变得很小，血痹，这是虚症嘛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"寸口关上微，尺中小紧，外证身体不仁，如风痹状，黄芪桂枝五物汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。黄芪桂枝五物汤呢？就是把灸甘草，桂枝汤把灸甘草拿掉，变成黄芪就好啦，那黄芪跟灸甘草，跟甘草本来就长的很像，哦，两个长的很像，那这里不用甘草，用黄芪，就是黄芪桂枝五物汤。差异呢，因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芪呢走表，所以皮肤麻木不仁的时候，只要病人有出现麻木不仁皮肤的时候，大家都可以想到要用黄芪，黄芪五物汤的来源就是这样"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160157-7k89xjj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160157-7k89xjj","updated":"20240422160157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个黄芪三钱哪，芍药，桂枝，这个黄芪五物汤里面呢？还有个地方，就是要重用生姜，因为生姜呢，这个我们这边讲哦，这里会重用生姜的原因就是因为“关上微”，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"关脉指的是胃脉，那胃脉比较微弱的时候，代表说胃里面比较寒湿，水份比较多"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以生姜加重，那你要不要记它？以后开了黄芪五物汤的时候，把生姜加重？不需要。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160157-mojludk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160157-mojludk","updated":"20240422160201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说，诸位呢一定要了解药性，这样的话你临症看到病人的时候，你马上自然直觉就要想到要这样子做，不用说去背很多东西，哦，所以很多东西你不要去背，要体会最重要，哦，体会。这样子你随时开个处方出来，为一个病人设计一个处方，哦，就不会有任何的错误。"}]}]}